# Scenario 'browser_bookmarks': ホームページ (browser) first-use tutorial read completely (14 pages, A each), the start prompt with its two
# buttons (ホームページ / ページリスト): the page list (bookmarks) while empty, then connect (dial, PPP, DNS, HTTP GET index.html from
# the fake server, web=all), START menu -> page list -> save the current page twice (icon 2 of the action bar), go to a saved page
